{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const NAVIGATION_KEYS: Set<NavigationKey>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L194","children":[{"type":"text","value":"constants.ts:194"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set of all valid navigation keys for cursor movement and document navigation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Includes arrow keys, Home/End (line navigation), and PageUp/PageDown (page navigation).\nThese keys are commonly combined with modifiers for selection (Shift+ArrowUp) or\nnavigation shortcuts (Alt+ArrowLeft for back)."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst NAVIGATION_KEYS: Set<NavigationKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [constants.ts:194](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L194)\n\nSet of all valid navigation keys for cursor movement and document navigation.\n\nIncludes arrow keys, Home/End (line navigation), and PageUp/PageDown (page navigation).\nThese keys are commonly combined with modifiers for selection (Shift+ArrowUp) or\nnavigation shortcuts (Alt+ArrowLeft for back).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: NAVIGATION_KEYS\ntitle: NAVIGATION_KEYS\n---\n\n```ts\nconst NAVIGATION_KEYS: Set<NavigationKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [constants.ts:194](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L194)\n\nSet of all valid navigation keys for cursor movement and document navigation.\n\nIncludes arrow keys, Home/End (line navigation), and PageUp/PageDown (page navigation).\nThese keys are commonly combined with modifiers for selection (Shift+ArrowUp) or\nnavigation shortcuts (Alt+ArrowLeft for back).\n"}
